{
  "slug": "klarity",
  "name": "Klarity",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Explore your org's processes and drive AI transformation",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `agent-builder` (Entry point for turning how your organization works into skills, agents, and automations), `within-process-context-graph` (Use to understand how work happens in the user's organization; references 'our' processes, SOPs, or workflows)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `within`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install klarity@claude-community` from `Within-AI/within-mcp`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
